From 3f029409c5412c8c3711bc58536443fc05799082 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Felipe Selmo <fselmo2@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 13:43:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] referencetests: let a caller ask for the parallel block
 processor

The reference-test protocol schedules hard-coded isParallelTxProcessingEnabled
to false, so MainnetParallelBlockProcessor was never built for any fixture
runner -- while a Bonsai node has parallel transaction processing on by
default. The flag is now a parameter, false for every existing caller.
